# Swashbuckler's Whip {1}, Equip {1}: "Equipped creature has reach, ...". Cast, then equipped to Memnite in turn 1 with one Mox, the pool left
# empty. In Bot2's turn 4 the equipped Memnite blocks Bot2's attacking Ornithopter (a 0/2 flyer) because it has reach, and deals it 1 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Swashbuckler's Whip
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swashbuckler's Whip.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swashbuckler's Whip.Activate(Ability: Equip; Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Reach
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Memnite > Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Swashbuckler's Whip.AttachedTo = Memnite
